    <briefdescription>
<para>extended linear exponential volatility model </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes an extended linear-exponential volatility model</para><para><formula id="162">\[ \sigma_i(t)=k_i*((a*(T_{i}-t)+d)*e^{-b(T_{i}-t)}+c) \]</formula> <verbatim>  References:

  Damiano Brigo, Fabio Mercurio, Massimo Morini, 2003,
  Different Covariance Parameterizations of Libor Market Model and Joint
  Caps/Swaptions Calibration,
  (&lt;http://www.business.uts.edu.au/qfrc/conferences/qmf2001/Brigo_D.pdf&gt;)</verbatim> </para>    </detaileddescription>
